# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Workspace policy: lib crate, do NOT commit the workspace lock file.
# v0.14 — anchored to the repo root (`/Cargo.lock`, not a bare `Cargo.lock`)
# so it does NOT also swallow `fuzz/Cargo.lock`: the cargo-fuzz binary
# workspace pins its lockfile for reproducible fuzzing, so that one IS
# committed (W0 codex finding).
/Cargo.lock

# v0.14 — cargo-fuzz derived output (build dir, grown corpus, crash repros).
# The committed surface is fuzz/Cargo.toml, fuzz/Cargo.lock,
# fuzz/fuzz_targets/, and the curated fuzz/seeds/.
fuzz/target/
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Tooling
*.profraw
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*

# Local agent-session metadata (worktrees, etc.)
.claude/

# Isolated implementation worktrees created by local tooling.
.worktrees/

# Local plan/spec scratch. Working notes are deliberately not published —
# see docs/disclosure-boundary.md §4; this pattern is the backstop for the
# times the convention is forgotten.
docs/superpowers/

# Local scan output (derived data: packs, session state, index).
.repolens/
